      "value": "@{610d538d5303a82960a415b4|full_name}\n\nThere are reason why app should added:\n\n- can scan your RFID from your IDcard, passport etc. This is less fraud sensitive compared to photo only check\n\n- many people who played in roblox or are on some sites who use Persona, have app already installed and age checked. No need to go through process again, just submit it and done.\n\n- app has better guide help to scan your face and make right photos.\n\n- also it has quicker result compared to browser way. I am verified in less than 5 minutes. That is quick.\n\n- app is free, why costs more? VRChat already pay Persona services so it should not matter in prices. VRChat is just not using API of Persona fully.\n\nUse website browser is only optical check (photos) and that makes it more fraud sensitive with fake ID cards or fake photos. It will take longer time imho.\n\nThis is why i am waiting for their answer.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
