  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-01-29T14:13:53.433Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I am sure part of people have app installed from Persona. The good side of the app is that it can use chip scanner to identify your ID card. This will make the process faster because its already safe check. \n\nNow i see VRChat uses browser (via email) Persona to make steps with photos. Because it's optical check, it will slow down the process more compared to app method.\n\nSo, why is app not even told in the instructions and i don't see steps to call the app for verified information and link with it. I don't need send or scan again my ID and my face. It's already done, so why is this not included?\n\nCan someone explain to me why app is not used here? Is there some problem with the app or the problem to link with it?",
